---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <div class="content article-page">

    <div class="card">
      <h1 class="article-title">
        New War Tool: Auto-Hit Feature in MyProfitLand
      </h1>
      <p class="meta">
        By <span class="gold-text">Mina Boles</span> · February 16, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img 
        class="article-image" 
        src="/imgs/autohitmina.jpeg" 
        alt="Auto-Hit feature overview"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="card article-body">

      <p>
        <strong>MyProfitLand</strong> has introduced a powerful new war tool that changes 
        how battles are managed. Announced on February 16, 2026, the 
        <strong>Auto-Hit</strong> feature allows players to participate in wars 
        even while being AFK (away from keyboard).
      </p>

      <h2>What Is the Auto-Hit Feature?</h2>

      <p>
        Auto-Hit enables automatic attack or defense actions based on your selected settings. 
        Once activated, the system deals damage on your behalf, 
        allowing you to stay active in wars without constant manual clicking.
      </p>

      <h2>How It Works</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Auto-Damage Mode:</strong>  
          A robot icon now appears next to the red “Deal Damage” button. 
          Clicking it activates auto mode for the current war.
        </li>
      </ul>

    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img 
        class="article-image" 
        src="/imgs/IMG_6714.jpeg" 
        alt="Auto-Hit activation button"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="card article-body">

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Consumables Support:</strong>  
          The system can automatically use items such as 
          <strong>coffee</strong> and <strong>mocaccinos</strong> 
          to maintain performance during battle.
        </li>
      </ul>

    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img 
        class="article-image" 
        src="/imgs/autihitsettings.jpeg" 
        alt="Auto-Hit settings"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="card article-body">

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>AFK Flexibility:</strong>  
          Stock up on weapons and supplies, activate Auto-Hit, 
          and let the system handle damage while you're away. 
          Keep in mind that risks like bombs or enemy attacks still apply.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Activation Cost</h2>

      <p>
        To use Auto-Hit, players must pay a small 
        <strong>sVCT fee</strong> per war. 
        The fee unlocks automatic damage for that specific battle.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img 
        class="article-image" 
        src="/imgs/autohit.jpeg" 
        alt="Auto-Hit in action"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="card article-body">

      <h2>Fair Play Protection</h2>

      <p>
        To prevent abuse and maintain competitive balance, 
        <strong>reCaptcha</strong> has been re-enabled for manual war damage. 
        This ensures legitimate participation and protects the integrity of the system.
      </p>

      <p>
        With Auto-Hit, MyProfitLand introduces a more strategic and flexible 
        war experience — allowing players to focus on planning while 
        automation handles execution.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>